    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "James G. Coughlan & Associates are delighted to bring 26 Glenview Park to the market.  Ideally located within 200 metres of Dillons Cross offering easy access to Cork city centre and Northern link road.  Well serviced by nearby Dunnes Stores Shopping Centre and Aldi, this charming 3 bedroomed semi-detached residence represents superb value and will appeal to first time buyers and investors alike.  Viewing highly recommended and strictly by appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "HALLWAY:\r\n16ft x 5ft 9. Power point, 1 light.\r\n\r\nLOUNGE:\r\n15ft 6 x 11ft 9.  Marble fireplace with raised hearth and timber surround, attractive bow window, light oak floor, radiator, 6 power points, 1 light and 1 window.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN/DINING ROOM:\r\n17ft 6 x 11ft 6.  Modern fitted kitchen with basin and a half stainless steel sink, extensive floor and eye level units, cooker hood, separate hob and oven, stone tiled floor, French doors to garden, radiator, 11 power points, 2 lights and 1 window.\r\n\r\nDOWNSTAIRS WC:\r\n2-piece white suite, tiled floor.\r\n\r\nLANDING:\r\nBright landing.  Hot press with dual immersion.\r\n\r\nBATHROOM:\r\n3-piece white suite, electric shower over bath, tiled walls and floor, radiator, 1 light and 1 window.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM NO. 1:\r\n14ft x 10ft.  Radiator, 4 power points, 1 light and 1 window.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM NO. 2:\r\n13ft x 10ft.  Sliding wardrobe, built-in shelving, radiator, 2 power points, 1 light and 1 window.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM NO. 3:\r\n10ft 3 x 7ft 6. Radiator, 2 power points, 1 light and 1 window.\r\n\r\nMessrs. James G. Coughlan & Associates for themselves and for the vendors or lessors of this property whose Agents they are given notice that:1)  The particulars are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchaser or lessees, and do not constitute, nor constitute part of, an offer or contract.  2)  All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and necessary permissions for use and occupation and other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct but any      intending purchasers or tenants should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them.  3)  No Person in the employment of Messrs. James G. Coughlan & Associates has the authority to make or give representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property"
      },
